docs {
  # WADO-RS: Get Instance Metadata

  Retrieve metadata for a specific instance.

  ## Path Parameters
  - `studyUID`: Study Instance UID
  - `seriesUID`: Series Instance UID
  - `sopInstanceUID`: SOP Instance UID
}
